    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Tida Quotes</strong> is a plugin that allows you to display your quotes or sentences in your WordPress dashboard. This plugin is actually a customization of the Hello Dolly plugin and is displayed in the WordPress dashboard beside the &#8216;Screen Options&#8217; or &#8216;Help&#8217; Tab. We&#8217;ve added the name of <a href=\"http://ma.tt\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Matt Mullenweg</strong></a>, the main contributor to the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/hello-dolly/\" rel=\"ugc\"><strong>Hello Dolly</strong><strong></strong></a> plugin, as a tribute to his contribution to the plugin. Of course, it is better to name this plugin: Advanced Hello Dolly or Customized Hello Dolly.</p>\n<p>If you also want to add your favorite collection of sentences to the Import data list, just send us an <a href=\"mailto:info@tidaweb.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">email</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>wp-content/plugins/tida-quotes</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='this%20plugin%20is%20free'>\nThis plugin is free\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it is free and no premium account is needed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with WP 6.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugs fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>launch first version</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Show Customized Quotes in WordPress Admin Dashboard",
    "description": "<p><strong>Tida Quotes</strong> is a plugin that allows you to display your quotes or sentences in your WordPress dashboard. This plugin is actually a customization of the Hello Dolly plugin and is displayed in the WordPress dashboard beside the &#8216;Screen Options&#8217; or &#8216;Help&#8217; Tab. We&#8217;ve added the name of <a href=\"http://ma.tt\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Matt Mullenweg</strong></a>, the main contributor to the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/hello-dolly/\" rel=\"ugc\"><strong>Hello Dolly</strong><strong></strong></a> plugin, as a tribute to his contribution to the plugin. Of course, it is better to name this plugin: Advanced Hello Dolly or Customized Hello Dolly.</p>\n<p>If you also want to add your favorite collection of sentences to the Import data list, just send us an <a href=\"mailto:info@tidaweb.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">email</a>.</p>\n",
